      "description": "Failed passes of the periodic live-store reconcile (game_live_store_reconciles_total{result=\"error\"}). The reconcile refills Redis from memory after an outage and sweeps stray seat/summary keys; a rising count means the live store and the server disagree and nothing is healing it.",
